{"id":9174,"date":"2021-04-18T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-04-18T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/enhancing-collaboration-during-parent-training\/"},"modified":"2024-10-03T17:19:56","modified_gmt":"2024-10-03T21:19:56","slug":"enhancing-collaboration-during-parent-training","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/enhancing-collaboration-during-parent-training\/","title":{"rendered":"Enhancing Collaboration During Parent Training"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9174\" class=\"elementor elementor-9174\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7fb42d2e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7fb42d2e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-14888803\" data-id=\"14888803\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8db315 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c8db315\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Clinicians often struggle with parental nonadherence to treatment recommendations made during parent training activities.<\/p>\n<p>Adherence may be improved by nurturing a collaborative relationship with family members. Collaboration requires specific relational responses of clinicians such as:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>actively and empathically listening<\/li>\n<li>compromising<\/li>\n<li>compassionately understanding each family\u2019s unique circumstance<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This talk will review strategies to foster collaboration with parents, with the goal of improving adherence to treatment recommendations <strong>and more!<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15020,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Enhancing Collaboration During Parent Training","_seopress_titles_desc":"This talk will review strategies to foster collaboration with parents, with the goal of improving adherence to treatment recommendations.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[109,354,86],"resource-tag":[365,269,277,159,324,133],"class_list":["post-9174","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-children","resource-topic-parenting","resource-topic-tips-tools-tech","resource-tag-collaboration","resource-tag-communication","resource-tag-family","resource-tag-family-activities","resource-tag-member-engagement","resource-tag-parents"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9174","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9174\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.